# ---------- Reference material (kept on disk, not in the repo) ----------
#
# The library repository ships the package, its tests and its docs.
# Everything below is the working material behind it — plans, audit
# reports, the competitor benchmark, the fixture harness, experiment
# runners — and it is kept here for reference rather than pushed to
# every clone.
#
# It is not lost: it is in the git history (commit f4c4795 has all of
# it), and it is on disk. `git checkout f4c4795 -- <path>` brings any
# of it back into the working tree.
/PLAN.md
/OSS.md
/ENterprise.md
/CHANGELOG.md
/requirements.txt
/requirements-ocr.txt
/requirements-rerank.txt
/requirements-optin.txt
/docs/audits/
/benchmark/
/tests/benchmarks/
